@startuml
title Fees, Payouts & Reconciliation — as-built read paths (all deterministic, over synced txns)

actor Partner as U
participant "report screens\n(fee_audit / payout_* / earnings / ledger_recon)" as Screen
participant "report handlers\n(*_report_handler.go)" as H
participant "app_lookup" as Lookup
database "TransactionRepo\n(gross/fee/net/processing)" as Repo
participant "FeeVerification /\nEarningsCalculator" as Svc

U -> Screen : open a Guard/earnings report (date range)
Screen -> H : GET /reports/{fee-audit|payout-schedule|payout-history|earnings|ledger-reconciliation}
H -> Lookup : resolveAppFromRequest (no org check, systemic D4)
H -> Repo : FindByAppID(range)  -> transactions

alt Fee Audit
  H -> H : buildFeeAudit: detected rate = shopifyFee/gross\nsnapToTierRate per-month (0/15/20) -> robust to $1M crossing
  H -> H : FeeGuardOk = |actual-expected| <= 1% gross ; savings vs 20% default
else Earnings / Payout Schedule / History
  H -> Svc : availableDate = chargeDate + 7d (refund immediate)\nstatus PENDING/AVAILABLE/PAID_OUT ; sum NetAmountCents per bucket
  note right of Svc : payout dates are ESTIMATES (7d), not real disbursement (D3)
else Ledger Reconciliation
  H -> H : per-month gross =? net + revenue_share + processing\n|residual| <= gross/100 (1% tol)
  H -> H : processing_suspect if derived processing% > 6.0% (heuristic, D2)
  H -> H : reconciled = bucketsClose AND !suspect (or gross<=0)
end

H --> Screen : JSON (+ optional CSV)

note over H,Svc
  Hardcoded assumptions (D1): tier 0/15/20 + default 20 ; processing 2.9% ; 7-day delay
  VerifyTransaction (per-tx) uses CONFIGURED tier -> unknown tier defaults to 0% (D5)
  Report path detects tier from DATA instead (robust)
end note
@enduml
